WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.634
-Good evening, everybody,
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.634 --> 00:00:04.067
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:06.400
And now, if you don't mind,
we are gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.300
Former Vice President Mike Pence
announced on Saturday

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.834
that he is ending
his presidential campaign,

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:14.400
and said, "This is not my time,"

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.834
but only because his time
is the 1950s.

00:00:17.834 --> 00:00:19.133
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:21.601
President Biden today
signed an executive order

00:00:21.601 --> 00:00:24.300
regulating artificial
intelligence technology.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:28.000
It's so stringent that he now
has to play himself

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.467
in Disney's Hall of Presidents.

00:00:30.467 --> 00:00:34.400
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.234
While speaking at
a campaign event yesterday

00:00:37.234 --> 00:00:39.267
in Sioux City, Iowa,
former President Trump

00:00:39.267 --> 00:00:42.200
mistakenly referred
to the South Dakota city

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.100
of Sioux Falls.
Well, that's it.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:47.334
He's got to be done now, right?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.334 --> 00:00:49.834
I mean, 91 felony charges
is one thing,

00:00:49.834 --> 00:00:52.801
but you can't mix up
the Sioux.

00:00:52.801 --> 00:00:56.667
According to a new survey,
75% of Americans believe

00:00:56.667 --> 00:00:59.801
that democracy is at risk in
the 2024 presidential election.

00:00:59.801 --> 00:01:03.634
And the other 25% is enough
to win the Electoral College.

00:01:03.634 --> 00:01:04.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.901 --> 00:01:07.234
Vice President Kamala Harris
appeared last night

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:09.367
on "60 minutes,"
which means that rescuers

00:01:09.367 --> 00:01:12.367
were finally able
to call off the search.

00:01:12.367 --> 00:01:15.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.834 --> 00:01:20.200
Vice President Kamala Harris
said in a new interview

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:22.601
that her relationship
with President Biden is similar

00:01:22.601 --> 00:01:25.434
to the one Biden had with
former President Barack Obama.

00:01:25.434 --> 00:01:27.100
Oh, so,
you think you're friends,

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:29.167
and he thinks you're co-workers?

00:01:29.167 --> 00:01:32.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.334
Minnesota Congressman
Dean Phillips

00:01:34.334 --> 00:01:36.000
announced on Friday
that he is launching

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.868
a primary challenge
to President Biden.

00:01:37.868 --> 00:01:40.667
Now, if you're familiar
with Dean Phillips,

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:44.033
then thank you for watching,
Mrs. Phillips.

00:01:44.033 --> 00:01:46.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.033 --> 00:01:48.567
Today was Ivanka Trump's
42nd birthday,

00:01:48.567 --> 00:01:49.868
and I just think it's nice

00:01:49.868 --> 00:01:52.200
she gets to spend it
with family.

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:54.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:58.133
According to a new estimate
from "Forbes" magazine,

00:01:58.133 --> 00:02:00.100
Taylor Swift
is now a billionaire,

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:03.701
which means that someone has
a difficult decision to make.

00:02:03.701 --> 00:02:07.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.033 --> 00:02:10.167
"On one hand,
I want to see it.

00:02:10.167 --> 00:02:13.367
On the other hand, billionaires
have too much money."

00:02:13.367 --> 00:02:17.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.434 --> 00:02:19.033
-New York Congressman
George Santos

00:02:19.033 --> 00:02:21.534
pleaded not guilty last week
to additional charges

00:02:21.534 --> 00:02:24.801
and then winked so hard
it gave him a smoky eye.

00:02:24.801 --> 00:02:26.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.601 --> 00:02:29.534
A 92-year-old man from Spain
recently completed

00:02:29.534 --> 00:02:32.167
a 24-mile hike
of the Grand Canyon.

00:02:32.167 --> 00:02:35.400
Said the man, "Last time
I was here, this was all flat."

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:37.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.501 --> 00:02:39.267
And finally,
the World Cheese Awards

00:02:39.267 --> 00:02:40.501
were held last week,

00:02:40.501 --> 00:02:43.267
and a blue cheese from Norway
won first place.

00:02:43.267 --> 00:02:45.467
And it was all going great
until...

00:02:45.467 --> 00:02:47.400
-I'm really happy for you.
I'mma let you finish.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:49.667
[ Laughter ]
-Kanye.

00:02:49.667 --> 00:02:52.534
Kanye, no.

00:02:52.534 --> 00:02:54.133
That was the monologue,
everybody.

00:02:54.133 --> 00:02:55.634
We're off and running.

